	(text "FDD Synth Duo rev C: an RP2350B that acts as a 3.5-inch floppy drive, with its sounds.\nPages: power; the RP2350B, flash and PSRAM; the floppy interface; the amp and panel headers; the microSD socket.\nNets cross pages through global labels. The GPIO map must agree with src/config.h and docs/wiring.md:\nhost/tests/test_revc_schematic.py checks it."
